The '''ring of suffering''' is an enchanted [[zenyte ring]], requiring a [[Hitpoints]] level of 75 to be equipped. It is the best-in-slot all-around defensive ring, only beaten by [[Ring of suffering (i)|its imbued variant]], the [[steel ring]] for melee defence, and the [[granite ring]] for ranged defence. This ring can be imbued into a [[ring of suffering (i)]] using 725,000 [[Nightmare Zone]] reward points, 300 [[Zeal Tokens]] from [[Soul Wars]], or a [[scroll of imbuing]] (which can be purchased for 200 [[Emir's Arena]] reward points). With completion of the [[Combat_Achievements/Hard|hard tier]] of [[Combat Achievements]], these costs are halved to 362,500 Nightmare Zone reward points and 150 Zeal Tokens from Soul Wars. A [[ring of suffering (i)]] has double the bonuses of a non-imbued ring.

